  "question": "What hotel can I find inside 100 kilometers to the north of Johnsonburg Swamp Preserve, Johnsonburg, NJ?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.867494 40.980105)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.867494 40.980105)',4326)::geography, 100000)\nAND tourism = 'hotel'\nAND ((degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 0.0 AND 22.5) OR (degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 337.5 AND 360));\n",
